{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : dtype} |= dtype_(v_1) = v_2
>>
Rule 6 (positive-definite hint agrees with spectrum values)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : bool} |= if v_2 then min(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 7 (non-singular hint: spectrum should not include zeros)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : bool} |= if v_2 then (min(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ max(v_1) ≠ 0)
